| `CMS-010` | Apercu de la landing | `/cms/apercu`                                                                     | meme route                 | lit les **colonnes vivantes** de `cms_sections` et `cms_carousel_items` (brouillon) + `list_cms_news()`, `list_cms_events()`, `get_cms_featured_profile_overview()`                                                                                                                    | `cms.read` ; publication `cms.publish`                                                                                                | `publish_cms_content` en boucle, puis `revalidateLanding()`                                                                          | `0021` E02 (une edition non publiee n'atteint pas le site)               | livre                                        |
